es. Project resolution order:\n#   1. --project flag (if passed)\n#   2. $PROJECT_SLUG env\n#   3. $PROJECT_CONFIG env (path to projects/<slug>.json)\n#   4. $PIPELINE_MANIFEST's \"project\" field\n#   5. fallback: \"coinography\"\n\n[725 more lines in file. Use offset=31 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781094571812}}
